.                                              │\n│ • **Unit Consistency:** Ensure mass is in kg and force is in N to        │\n│   obtain acceleration in $m/s^2$.                                        │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ **Suggested Questions**                                                  │\n│                                                                          │\n│ 1. What would happen to the acceleration if the force was doubled to     │\n│    100 N?                                                                │\n│ 2. If the mass was increased to 20 kg while the force remained 50 N,     │\n│    how would the acceleration change?                                    │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
